@startuml api-openapi-json
title GET /api/openapi.json — logic swimlanes

skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F8F8F8
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #333333

|Client|
start
:GET /api/openapi.json;

|OpenApiController|
:Resolve path **docs/api.json**;
if (file missing or empty?) then (yes)
  :throw RuntimeException;
  stop
endif
:Read file; **json_decode** validate object;
if (invalid JSON?) then (yes)
  :throw RuntimeException;
  stop
endif
:Build **JsonResponse** +\n**Cache-Control: public, max-age=300**;

|Client|
:200 JSON (OpenAPI document);
stop

@enduml
